      "text": "This is why I like to do WebDev in PowerShell, sans dependencies.\n\nPowerShell is a great language, and it's WebDev ecosystem is much more than just a couple of modules that can run as servers.\n\nI get the want for a \"one stop shop\", but sometimes we need to customize."
